<title>UK: Venantius sets 10 bln pesata September 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>Venantius sets 10 bln pesata September 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Argentaria and Banco Santander de</p>
<p>Negocios.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VENANTIUS AB</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON    *6.427     MATURITY   *05.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    05.AUG.97</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAYS COUPON ON 04.AUG.97, 04.AUG.98 AND 04.AUG.99</p>
<p>		ONLY.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    AIAF	DNEOMS (K)  100</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
